{"id": 4312, "title": "A Beautiful Word", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "a-beautiful-word", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4312_a-beautiful-word.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["牛津大学有一个叫凯丽的女孩。上大学前，她一直都是好学生，但到牛津大学后，她却成为了全班最差的学生。其实，并不是凯丽不聪明，也不是她不努力，而是她太自卑了。", "一天，凯丽正在上课，有个人走进教室说，他要在班里找一个最漂亮的女孩做他们公司的形象代言人。这个人看了看教室里的学生，最后指着凯丽说：\"就是她，她是我眼中最美丽的女孩。”", "其实，这个人是凯丽的父亲找来的，为的是帮助凯丽找回自信。从此，凯丽又有了自信，并成为了一个优秀的学生。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["牛津大學有一個叫凱麗的女孩。上大學前，她一直都是好學生，但到牛津大學後，她卻成為了全班最差的學生。其實，並不是凱麗不聰明，也不是她不努力，而是她太自卑了。", "一天，凱麗正在上課，有個人走進教室說，他要在班裡找一個最漂亮的女孩做他們公司的形象代言人。這個人看了看教室裡的學生，最後指著凱麗說：\"就是她，她是我眼中最美麗的女孩。”", "其實，這個人是凱麗的父親找來的，為的是幫助凱麗找回自信。從此，凱麗又有了自信，並成為了一個優秀的學生。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Niú jīn Dà xué yǒu yī gè jiào Kǎi Lì de nǚ hái。 shàng dà xué qián， tā yī zhí dōu shì hǎo xué shēng， dàn dào Niú jīn Dà xué hòu， tā què chéng wéi le quán bān zuì chà de xué shēng。 qí shí， bìng bù shì Kǎi Lì bù cōng míng， yě bù shì tā bù nǔ lì， ér shì tā tài zì bēi le。", "yī tiān， Kǎi Lì zhèng zài shàng kè， yǒu gè rén zǒu jìn jiào shì shuō， tā yào zài bān lǐ zhǎo yī gè zuì piào liang de nǚ hái zuò tā men gōng sī de xíng xiàng dài yán rén。 zhè gè rén kàn le kàn jiào shì lǐ de xué shēng， zuì hòu zhǐ zhe Kǎi Lì shuō：\" jiù shì tā， tā shì wǒ yǎn zhōng zuì měi lì de nǚ hái。”", "qí shí， zhè gè rén shì Kǎi Lì de fù qīn zhǎo lái de， wèi de shì bāng zhù Kǎi Lì zhǎo huí zì xìn。 cóng cǐ， Kǎi Lì yòu yǒu le zì xìn， bìng chéng wéi le yī gè yōu xiù de xué shēng。"], "english_paragraphs": ["There is a girl named Kelly at Oxford University. Before going to college, she had always been a good student, but after arriving at Oxford, she became the worst student in the class. In fact, it's not that Kelly isn't smart or doesn't work hard, it's that she has too low self-esteem.", "One day, Kelly was in class, and someone walked into the classroom and said that he wanted to find the most beautiful girl in the class to be the image spokesperson of their company. The man looked at the students in the classroom, and finally pointed at Kelly and said, \"That's her. She is the most beautiful girl in my eyes.\"", "In fact, this person was found by Kelly's father to help Kelly regain her confidence. From then on, Kelly gained confidence again and became an excellent student."], "english_full": "There is a girl named Kelly at Oxford University. Before going to college, she had always been a good student, but after arriving at Oxford, she became the worst student in the class. In fact, it's not that Kelly isn't smart or doesn't work hard, it's that she has too low self-esteem.\n\nOne day, Kelly was in class, and someone walked into the classroom and said that he wanted to find the most beautiful girl in the class to be the image spokesperson of their company. The man looked at the students in the classroom, and finally pointed at Kelly and said, \"That's her. She is the most beautiful girl in my eyes.\"\n\nIn fact, this person was found by Kelly's father to help Kelly regain her confidence. From then on, Kelly gained confidence again and became an excellent student.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Niú jīn Dà xué\" data-defn=\"University of Oxford\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">牛津大学</span><span class=\"tr\">牛津大學</span><rt>Niú jīn Dà xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiào\" data-defn=\"to be called\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Kǎi Lì\" data-defn=\"a personal name; Kelly\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">凯丽</span><span class=\"tr\">凱麗</span><rt>Kǎi Lì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ hái\" data-defn=\"girl; lass\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">女孩</span><span class=\"tr\">女孩</span><rt>nǚ hái</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng\" data-defn=\"to attend (class or university)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà xué\" data-defn=\"university / college\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">大学</span><span class=\"tr\">大學</span><rt>dà xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qián\" data-defn=\"ago / before / BC / former / formerly\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī zhí\" data-defn=\"straight (in a straight line) / continuously; always; all the way through\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">一直</span><span class=\"tr\">一直</span><rt>yī zhí</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"good / appropriate; proper\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><s